          "_id": "5cdf1af905823b0062ac947c",
          "bio": "In conformity with the late author's wish, her Board of Literary Management asks us to record that, in 1941, Laura (Riding) Jackson renonunced, on grounds of linguistic principle, the writing of poetry; she had come to hold that 'poetry obstructs general attainment to something better in our linguistic way-of-life than we have.\"",
